Output "/tmp/npvz-input-navigation.gif"
Set Shell "bash"
Set Width 866
Set Height 520
Set FontSize 14
Set TypingSpeed 0ms

Type "TERM=xterm-256color ./npvz"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Up
Sleep 800ms
Down
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Up
Sleep 800ms
Down
Enter
Type "g"
Sleep 1s
Up
Right
Sleep 1s
Type "p"
Sleep 600ms
Up
Sleep 800ms
Down
Up
Enter
Sleep 600ms
Up
Enter
Sleep 500ms
